<title>USA: Meridian files shelf for $600mln debt,equity.</title>
<headline>Meridian files shelf for $600mln debt,equity.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Industrial Trust Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration of up to $600 million in debt securities, preferred, common shares and warrants.</p>
<p>The San Francisco-based real estate company said it may use the proceeds from the sale to acquire new properties, repay outstanding debt, finance capital improvements and for other general corporate needs.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf registration.</p>
